  "description": "⚠️ DEVELOPMENT USE ONLY ⚠️ A static-key Key Encryption Provider for Vellum, intended exclusively for local development, tests, and samples. Wraps and unwraps Data Encryption Keys with an AES-256-GCM key loaded from configuration. NEVER use this package in production — the KEK lives next to the application and has the same security as the config file it came from.",
